OL,3,GNEWSAHovercraft services cancelled due
OL,4,Ato weather
OL,5,
OL,6,FSeveral hovercraft services between
OL,7,FHampshire and the Isle of Wight were
OL,8,Fcancelled on Saturday following a
OL,9,Ftechnical issue and bad weather
OL,10,Fconditions.
OL,12,FHovertravel said its Island Flyer
OL,13,Fsuffered a door failure at Southsea at
OL,14,F12:30 BST and passengers were
OL,15,F"transferred to an alternative
OL,16,Ftransport option".
OL,18,FPassengers experienced cancellations
OL,19,Fand delays between Ryde and Southsea
OL,20,Fthroughout the afternoon and evening,
OL,21,Faffecting people travelling to the
OL,22,FVictorious Festival in Portsmouth.
OL,23,APub: 29-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
